notes: 'Both primary recipes explicitly use30g Press yeast;202 additionally containsCaCO3
  in the receiving medium. Preserve pressed/compressed biomass state without assigning
  species, manufacturer, moisture percentage, viability or commercial baker-yeast
  equivalence. The ingredient is not the potato/liver infusions prepared separately.
  Raw labels retained as occurrence provenance only: [''Press yeast'']. Identity is
  the stated physical material, not an arbitrary recipe-specific duplicate. Existing
  generic yeast, baker yeast and wet cell paste do not establish this supplied state.'
